<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS indica che un'espressione deriva da un'altra espressione assunta come fonte nella sua creazione. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R76 è derivato di"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it states that an expression derives from another expression used as a source in its creation. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R76 is derivative of"@en .
